# What goes in /APPS on the disk image (tools/mkhdimg.py; makefile).
# The Apps menu is that folder: each folder is a group. A line per file:
#   <path in /APPS> | <name> | <size> [group]
#                                  a bundled app: build/extapps/<name>.APP.
#                                  Setup's choices (SETUP.INF): size min,
#                                  medium or full (the smallest install it is
#                                  in), group media, games or net (left out
#                                  when the user says no to those)
#   <path in /APPS> | @<target>    a shortcut (.LNK): a built-in app's name,
#                                  an .APP's name, or a path (always there)
FileF.LNK                         | @FileF
Settings.LNK                      | @Settings
Help.LNK                          | @Help

Accessories/ASMDraw.APP           | asmdraw       | medium
Accessories/Calculator.APP        | calculator    | min
Accessories/Calendar.APP          | calendar      | medium
Accessories/CharMap.LNK           | @Character Map
Accessories/ClipView.APP          | clipview      | medium
Accessories/Clock.APP             | clock         | min
Accessories/Picture Viewer.APP    | picview       | medium media
Accessories/TEditor.LNK           | @TEditor

Games/Puzzle.APP                  | puzzle        | medium games
Games/Sudoku.APP                  | sudoku        | full games
Games/Solitaire.APP               | solitaire     | full games

Multimedia/Audio Player.APP       | audioplayer   | full media

Internet/World View.APP           | worldview     | full net

System Tools/ASMTerm.LNK          | @ASMTerm
System Tools/Format Disk.LNK      | @Format Disk
System Tools/HexView.APP          | hexview       | full
System Tools/Monitor.LNK          | @Monitor
